#冲突测试：故意让 OT 与 DIAGONALIZATION / MIXING / SMEAR 共存，用于验证校验能正确检测互斥冲突
&GLOBAL
  PROJECT test_conflict
  RUN_TYPE ENERGY
&END GLOBAL

&FORCE_EVAL
  METHOD Quickstep
  &DFT
    &MGRID
      CUTOFF 400
      REL_CUTOFF 50
    &END MGRID
    &SCF
      MAX_SCF 128
      EPS_SCF 5.0E-06
      &OT
        PRECONDITIONER FULL_ALL
        MINIMIZER DIIS
      &END OT
      &DIAGONALIZATION
        ALGORITHM STANDARD
      &END DIAGONALIZATION
      &MIXING
        METHOD BROYDEN_MIXING
        ALPHA 0.4
      &END MIXING
      &SMEAR ON
        METHOD FERMI_DIRAC
        ELECTRONIC_TEMPERATURE 300
      &END SMEAR
    &END SCF
  &END DFT
&END FORCE_EVAL
